#: ../../tools/pinnacle_tools.rst:32 01931927dfcb437499121fa9c6b787d8
msgid ""
"**Description**: Retrieves cell-type-specific protein-protein interaction"
" embeddings from PINNACLE. This tool provides access to pre-computed "
"PINNACLE (Protein Interaction Network Contextualized Learning) embeddings"
" that represent protein-protein interactions in specific cellular "
"contexts. These embeddings encode functional relationships between "
"proteins as dense vector representations, capturing both direct physical "
"interactions and functional associations."
msgstr ""
"**描述**: 从PINNACLE检索细胞类型特异性的蛋白质-蛋白质相互作用嵌入。此工具提供预先计算的PINNACLE（Protein "
"Interaction Network Contextualized "
"Learning，蛋白质相互作用网络上下文化学习）嵌入，这些嵌入表示特定细胞环境中的蛋白质-蛋白质相互作用。嵌入以密集向量表示蛋白质之间的功能关系，捕捉直接的物理相互作用和功能关联。"

#: ../../tools/pinnacle_tools.rst:34 50774c867bcc4359b1151c50350b3676
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr "**参数：**"

#: ../../tools/pinnacle_tools.rst:36 bf5fd15eb8c94b808e1bbd7fe1445b48
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``cell_type`` (string) (required) Target cell type for embedding "
"retrieval. Supports flexible naming: Standard formats: 'b\\_cell', "
"'hepatocyte', 'cardiomyocyte'; Alternative formats: 'B-cell', 'T cell', "
"'NK cells'; Tissue types: 'liver', 'heart', 'brain', 'immune'. The tool "
"performs intelligent matching to find the best available match."
msgstr ""
"``cell_type``（字符串）（必填）目标细胞类型，用于嵌入检索。支持灵活的命名方式：标准格式：'b_cell'、'hepatocyte'、'cardiomyocyte'；替代格式：'B-cell'、'T"
" cell'、'NK "
"cells'；组织类型：'liver'、'heart'、'brain'、'immune'。该工具会执行智能匹配以找到最佳可用匹配项。"

#: ../../tools/pinnacle_tools.rst:39 de2fb28890c9464a865e7e390b6ed936
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``embed_path`` (string) (required) Path to the PINNACLE embeddings file "
"(.pth format). If None, uses "
"PINNACLE\\_DATA\\_PATH/pinnacle\\_embeds/ppi\\_embed\\_dict.pth."
msgstr "``embed_path``（字符串）（可选）指定PINNACLE嵌入文件的路径（.pth格式）。如果为None，则使用PINNACLE_DATA_PATH/pinnacle_embeds/ppi_embed_dict.pth。"

